+// prism_premium's growth: a gem kept in a Prism's bag adds camp output that farms `rate` gems a round
+// (its Focus's output x the team's gems per output-round), which join the bag and compound, so over
+// `rounds` kept the gem becomes exp(rate rounds) gems: expm1 of it beyond itself. The draft's opening
+// plan prices it too, from the same priors before any game data.
+inline float kept_gem_growth(float rate, float rounds) { return std::expm1(rate * std::max(0.0f, rounds)); }
